OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows perform flypast after
OL,4,Acancelled display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows will perform a flypast
OL,7,Fover the Dorset coast on Saturday, two
OL,8,Fweeks after a display was cancelled due
OL,9,Fto them being stranded in Canada.
OL,11,FThe RAF aerobatic team had been due to
OL,12,Fdisplay at the Lyme Regis RNLI Lifeboat
OL,13,FWeek on 16 August but pulled out after
OL,14,Fpoor weather left them grounded at
OL,15,FGoose Bay.
OL,17,FThe gap in the schedule was filled by
OL,18,Fwheelbarrow performance group the
OL,19,FBradninch Red Barrows.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
