OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows perform flypast after
OL,4,Acancelled display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows will fly in formation
OL,7,Fover the seafront and Lyme Bay at 12:33
OL,8,FBST, en route to the English Riviera
OL,9,FAirshow in Torbay, Devon.
